E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(desc);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hf;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PxRigidStatic</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createTerrainActor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PxHeightField</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> hf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> worldSize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                   float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> worldHeight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PxPhysics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> physics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 高度场的尺度：rowScale/columnScale 是格间距，heightScale 是高度系数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cellSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> worldSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (hf-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getNbColumns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    PxHeightFieldGeometry </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">geom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(hf, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PxMeshGeometryFlags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        /*heightScale*/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> worldHeight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 32767.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        /*rowScale*/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cellSize,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        /*colScale*/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cellSize);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    PxMaterial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> physics-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createMaterial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 摩擦/弹力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    PxRigidStatic</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PxCreateStatic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">physics, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">PxTransform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(PxIdentity),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                                           geom, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mat);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actor;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 PhysX 中 Height Field 的行列方向与渲染约定的 X/Z 轴的对应关系需要明确处理，否则碰撞体会旋转 90°。</p>\n<h3 id=\"jolt-physics-高度场\">Jolt Physics 高度场</h3><p>Jolt Physics（2022 年兴起的开源物理引擎）使用类似接口：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"#include &lt;Jolt/Physics/Collision/Shape/HeightFieldShape.h&gt;&#10;&#10;JPH::Ref&lt;JPH::Shape&gt; createJoltHeightField(const Heightmap&amp; hm) {&#10;    HeightFieldShapeSettings settings;&#10;    settings.mOffset   = Vec3(0, 0, 0);&#10;    settings.mScale    = Vec3(hm.cellSize, worldHeight, hm.cellSize);&#10;    settings.mSampleCount = hm.width;&#10;&#10;    // Jolt 使用 float 高度（[0,1] 已归一化）&#10;    settings.mHeightSamples.resize(hm.width * hm.height);&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; hm.width * hm.height; i++) {&#10;        settings.mHeightSamples[i] = hm.data[i];&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    auto result = settings.Create();&#10;    return result.Get();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;Jolt/Physics/Collision/Shape/HeightFieldShape.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">JPH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">JPH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Shape</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createJoltHeightField</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Heightmap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> hm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    HeightFieldShapeSettings settings;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    settings.mOffset   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vec3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    settings.mScale    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Vec3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(hm.cellSize, worldHeight, hm.cellSize);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    settings.mSampleCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hm.width;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // Jolt 使用 float 高度（[0,1] 已归一化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    settings.mHeightSamples.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(hm.width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hm.height);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hm.width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hm.height; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        settings.mHeightSamples[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hm.data[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> settings.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"射线与高度场的交叉\">射线与高度场的交叉</h2><p>游戏中大量操作需要射线-地形交叉：鼠标点击地形（拾取位置）、AI 寻路的地面高度查询、弹道轨迹与地面的碰撞检测。</p>\n<p>物理引擎提供的射线检测开销约 0.01-0.1ms/次（取决于引擎和场景复杂度），对于高频调用（如每帧 100 次的 AI 高度查询），直接用物理引擎过于昂贵。</p>\n<h3 id=\"快速高度查询\">快速高度查询</h3><p>对于只需要地面高度（不需要法线等信息）的查询，直接从高度图双线性插值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"float getTerrainHeightFast(float wx, float wz, const Heightmap&amp; hm) {&#10;    // 比物理引擎快 100 倍，但不考虑洞穴等悬空地形&#10;    return hm.sampleWorld(wx, wz) * worldHeight;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getTerrainHeightFast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> wx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> wz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Heightmap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> hm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 比物理引擎快 100 倍，但不考虑洞穴等悬空地形</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hm.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sampleWorld</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(wx, wz) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> worldHeight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种方式适合 95% 的高度查询场景（AI、植被布置、地表粒子效果等），只有需要正确处理多层地形（洞穴顶底）时才使用物理引擎射线检测。</p>\n<h3 id=\"gpu-射线-高度场交叉-heightmap-raycast\">GPU 射线-高度场交叉（Heightmap Raycast）</h3><p>鼠标拾取地形点通常在 Compute Shader 中实现，利用 GPU 并行与高度图采样：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"// Compute Shader：高度图射线检测&#10;// 从相机位置沿视线方向步进，找到与高度图的交叉点&#10;&#10;layout(local_size_x = 1) in;&#10;uniform sampler2D u_heightmap;&#10;uniform vec3  u_rayOrigin;    // 视线起点（世界坐标）&#10;uniform vec3  u_rayDir;       // 归一化视线方向&#10;uniform float u_maxDist;      // 最大检测距离&#10;uniform float u_worldSize;&#10;uniform float u_worldHeight;&#10;&#10;layout(std430, binding = 0) buffer Result {&#10;    vec3 hitPoint;  // 交叉点世界坐标（若未命中则 y &lt; 0）&#10;};&#10;&#10;void main() {&#10;    vec3 pos = u_rayOrigin;&#10;    float stepSize = u_worldSize / 1024.0; // 初始步长&#10;    float t = 0;&#10;&#10;    // 粗粒度步进：找到大致交叉区间&#10;    float lastAbove = 0;&#10;    bool hit = false;&#10;    while (t &lt; u_maxDist) {&#10;        pos = u_rayOrigin + u_rayDir * t;&#10;        vec2 uv = pos.xz / u_worldSize;&#10;        if (uv.x &lt; 0 || uv.x &gt; 1 || uv.y &lt; 0 || uv.y &gt; 1) break;&#10;&#10;        float terrainH = texture(u_heightmap, uv).r * u_worldHeight;&#10;        if (pos.y &lt; terrainH) {&#10;            // 在 [t - stepSize, t] 内二分细化&#10;            float lo = t - stepSize, hi = t;&#10;            for (int i = 0; i &lt; 8; i++) {&#10;                float mid = (lo + hi) * 0.5;&#10;                vec3 midPos = u_rayOrigin + u_rayDir * mid;&#10;                float mH = texture(u_heightmap, midPos.xz / u_worldSize).r * u_worldHeight;&#10;                if (midPos.y &lt; mH) hi = mid; else lo = mid;&#10;            }&#10;            pos = u_rayOrigin + u_rayDir * ((lo + hi) * 0.5);&#10;            hit = true;&#10;            break;&#10;        }&#10;        // 步长随距离增大（远处精度要求低）&#10;        lastAbove = t;&#10;        t += stepSize;&#10;        stepSize = max(stepSize * 1.05, 1.0);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    hitPoint = hit ? pos : vec3(0, -1, 0);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Compute Shader：高度图射线检测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 从相机位置沿视线方向步进，找到与高度图的交叉点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(local_size_x = 1) in;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>uniform sampler2D u_heightmap;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>uniform vec3  u_rayOrigin;    // 视线起点（世界坐标）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>uniform vec3  u_rayDir;       // 归一化视线方向</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>uniform float u_maxDist;      // 最大检测距离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>uniform float u_worldSize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>uniform float u_worldHeight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>layout(std430, binding = 0) buffer Result {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 hitPoint;  // 交叉点世界坐标（若未命中则 y &#x3C; 0）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    vec3 pos = u_rayOrigin;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float stepSize = u_worldSize / 1024.0; // 初始步长</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float t = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 粗粒度步进：找到大致交叉区间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float lastAbove = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bool hit = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    while (t &#x3C; u_maxDist) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        pos = u_rayOrigin + u_rayDir * t;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        vec2 uv = pos.xz / u_worldSize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (uv.x &#x3C; 0 || uv.x > 1 || uv.y &#x3C; 0 || uv.y > 1) break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float terrainH = texture(u_heightmap, uv).r * u_worldHeight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (pos.y &#x3C; terrainH) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 在 [t - stepSize, t] 内二分细化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            float lo = t - stepSize, hi = t;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            for (int i = 0; i &#x3C; 8; i++) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                float mid = (lo + hi) * 0.5;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                vec3 midPos = u_rayOrigin + u_rayDir * mid;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                float mH = texture(u_heightmap, midPos.xz / u_worldSize).r * u_worldHeight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (midPos.y &#x3C; mH) hi = mid; else lo = mid;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            pos = u_rayOrigin + u_rayDir * ((lo + hi) * 0.5);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            hit = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 步长随距离增大（远处精度要求低）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        lastAbove = t;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        t += stepSize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        stepSize = max(stepSize * 1.05, 1.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    hitPoint = hit ? pos : vec3(0, -1, 0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"地形与角色控制器\">地形与角色控制器</h2><p>角色控制器（Character Controller）站在地形上时，需要正确处理斜坡：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"class TerrainCharacterController {&#10;    float maxSlopeAngle = 50.0f; // 度：超过此坡度滑落&#10;&#10;public:&#10;    // 每帧更新角色位置，贴合地形&#10;    void update(glm::vec3&amp; position, glm::vec3 moveInput, float dt) {&#10;        // 物理引擎移动角色（碰撞与地形）&#10;        physicsController-&gt;move(moveInput * dt);&#10;&#10;        // 获取脚下地形信息&#10;        float terrainH = physicsEngine-&gt;raycastDown(position).hitHeight;&#10;        float slope    = physicsEngine-&gt;getSlope(position);&#10;&#10;        // 斜坡处理&#10;        if (slope &gt; maxSlopeAngle) {&#10;            // 斜坡太陡：沿斜坡方向施加重力分量使角色下滑&#10;            glm::vec3 slideDir = getSlopeDirection(position);&#10;            physicsController-&gt;addVelocity(slideDir * GRAVITY * dt);&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        // 吸附到地形（防止抖动）&#10;        if (position.y &lt; terrainH + CHARACTER_HEIGHT / 2 + SNAP_THRESHOLD) {&#10;            position.y = terrainH + CHARACTER_HEIGHT / 2;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TerrainCharacterController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxSlopeAngle </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 50.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 度：超过此坡度滑落</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 每帧更新角色位置，贴合地形</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">glm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vec3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">glm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vec3</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> moveInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> dt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 物理引擎移动角色（碰撞与地形）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        physicsController-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">move</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(moveInput </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 获取脚下地形信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> terrainH </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> physicsEngine-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">raycastDown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(position).hitHeight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slope    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> physicsEngine-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getSlope</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(position);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 斜坡处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (slope </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> maxSlopeAngle) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // 斜坡太陡：沿斜坡方向施加重力分量使角色下滑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            glm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::vec3 slideDir </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getSlopeDirection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(position);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            physicsController-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addVelocity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(slideDir </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GRAVITY </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 吸附到地形（防止抖动）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (position.y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> terrainH </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CHARACTER_HEIGHT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SNAP_THRESHOLD) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            position.y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> terrainH </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CHARACTER_HEIGHT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"洞穴与多层地形\">洞穴与多层地形</h2><p>平面高度场碰撞体无法表示洞穴（同一 (x, z) 有多个高度值）。洞穴通常用<strong>独立碰撞网格</strong>叠加：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"// 洞穴区域用 PxTriangleMesh 而非高度场&#10;// 在洞穴区域&quot;挖空&quot;高度场，用三角网格填充&#10;// 高度场有个 &quot;hole&quot; 标志位，可以标记无效格点&#10;&#10;PxHeightFieldSample&amp; s = samples[z * cols + x];&#10;s.materialIndex0 = PxHeightFieldMaterial::eHOLE; // 该格点是洞\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 洞穴区域用 PxTriangleMesh 而非高度场</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在洞穴区域\"挖空\"高度场，用三角网格填充</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 高度场有个 \"hole\" 标志位，可以标记无效格点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PxHeightFieldSample</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> samples[z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cols </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">s.materialIndex0 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PxHeightFieldMaterial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::eHOLE;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 该格点是洞</span></span></code></pre></div><p>洞穴的高精度碰撞模型由关卡设计师手动创建，与程序化地形高度场共存，地形系统在洞穴区域的高度场打洞，让玩家过渡到洞穴碰撞体时无感知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"物理性能预算\">物理性能预算</h2><p>地形碰撞的性能特性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>典型开销</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Height Field 创建（1025²）</td>\n<td>50ms</td>\n<td>仅在 Chunk 加载时执行一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>射线检测（单次）</td>\n<td>0.05ms</td>\n<td>物理引擎 CPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快速高度查询（双线性）</td>\n<td>0.001ms</td>\n<td>直接数组访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Character Controller 更新</td>\n<td>0.5ms/角色</td>\n<td>含斜坡/阶梯处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100 棵树碰撞体注册</td>\n<td>2ms</td>\n<td>仅一次性操作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在移动端（iOS/Android），Height Field 碰撞体的内存占用需要特别关注：257×257 的 Chunk 使用 int16 格式约 132KB，但物理引擎内部会构建 BVH 加速结构，额外消耗约 50KB，16个可见 Chunk 合计约 2.9MB 仅用于碰撞数据，通常可接受。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>地形物理的核心是三种技术的分工：Height Field 碰撞体负责精确物理模拟（射线检测、角色碰撞），以 int16 格式和 BVH 加速结构在巨大地形上维持 O(1) 碰撞定位；快速高度查询（双线性插值）用于高频纯高度采样（植被落点、AI 导航），绕过物理引擎直接访问高度图数组；GPU 射线步进处理批量并行射线（子弹轨迹、大量 AI 视线），充分利用 Compute Shader 并行性。洞穴通过 eHOLE 标志在高度场打洞并配合手工碰撞体实现，角色控制器坡度阈值防止攀爬不合理坡面。三者组合覆盖游戏中 95% 以上的地形物理需求。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"地形物理与碰撞","id":"地形物理与碰撞"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Height Field 碰撞体","id":"height-field-碰撞体"},{"level":3,"text":"PhysX Height Field 创建","id":"physx-height-field-创建"},{"level":3,"text":"Jolt Physics 高度场","id":"jolt-physics-高度场"},{"level":2,"text":"射线与高度场的交叉","id":"射线与高度场的交叉"},{"level":3,"text":"快速高度查询","id":"快速高度查询"},{"level":3,"text":"GPU 射线-高度场交叉（Heightmap Raycast）","id":"gpu-射线-高度场交叉-heightmap-raycast"},{"level":2,"text":"地形与角色控制器","id":"地形与角色控制器"},{"level":2,"text":"洞穴与多层地形","id":"洞穴与多层地形"},{"level":2,"text":"物理性能预算","id":"物理性能预算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分块流式加载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/engineering/chunk-streaming"},"next":{"title":"地形编辑工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/engineering/terrain-editor"}}